{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019sSFJLzZsvgFtushQ89LX6","type":"tool_result","content":"197:- `px.blend(g, a, mode, fn)`: draw fn() at alpha a (stepped, like PS1 hardware) with a blend mode: 'normal', 'add', 'multiply', 'screen' (E.style.trans = 'dither' dithers instead)\n199:- `px.ddisc(g, cx, cy, r, c, a, wx = 0, wy = 0)`: soft disc that fades toward its edge (glows, smoke, dust): stepped alpha rings, or dithering in 'dither' style\n202:- `px.ell(g, cx, cy, rx, ry, c)`: a filled ellipse\n209:- `px.sprite(g, spr, x, y, flip = false)`: draw a sprite with its top-left corner at buffer pixel (x, y). flip mirrors it left-right; or o: { flip, rot (radians, turned about its center: E.rotSpri","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65d0dba4-d8b1-427b-bda2-f14280ca26ea","uuid":"49b59d9d-2fb0-450b-8b92-84aa275b957d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:02:37.795Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"197:- `px.blend(g, a, mode, fn)`: draw fn() at alpha a (stepped, like PS1 hardware) with a blend mode: 'normal', 'add', 'multiply', 'screen' (E.style.trans = 'dither' dithers instead)\n199:- `px.ddisc(g, cx, cy, r, c, a, wx = 0, wy = 0)`: soft disc that fades toward its edge (glows, smoke, dust): stepped alpha rings, or dithering in 'dither' style\n202:- `px.ell(g, cx, cy, rx, ry, c)`: a filled ellipse\n209:- `px.sprite(g, spr, x, y, flip = false)`: draw a sprite with its top-left corner at buffer pixel (x, y). flip mirrors it left-right; or o: { flip, rot (radians, turned about its center: E.rotSpri","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019sSFJLzZsvgFtushQ89LX6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
