{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh7DsmET3Dy9VPDEAGBX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01V5P3tR9bs3588mPXaNctBp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"rm -f tools/dbg.cjs; cat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine patches (BENTOU PATCH n)\n\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js` is the my-3D2dge v0.85.2 handoff engine with these small edits, applied by `node tools/patch-engine.mjs`\nfrom the pristine `handoff/my-3d2dge.js`. Each edit is marked `BENTOU PATCH n` in the source.\n\n1. Pixel font: the PlayStation face buttons ✕ ○ □ △ in the 5x7 font, so prompts render on canvas.\n2. Button symbols setting: PlayStation by default, Xbox as the option.\n3. Humanoid gear: cloth and oni masks (portraits too), jingasa and kabuto hats, yari (spear), bow, kanabo (club), an\n   offhand blade, a sashimono banner.\n4. Shell: custom screens may show settings rows (`rows: [keys]`); the 'Dev' group never shows in the player's Settings.\n5. Shell: the mouse over a button or slider moves the focus there.\n6. Shell: a 10-foot scale (`--ui`, by window height times the Interface size setting), larger base text and buttons.\n7. Music: per-track `pluck` / `ring` (plucked notes ring and decay), `attack` and `release`.\n8. Audio: `audio.voiceBus`, a gain for the gibberish voices (the Voices setting).\n9. Pause: `E.pauseGuard(game)` may veto the pause press (the AI Hub owns Create + Options).\nEOF\ncat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# Bentou 2: Birth of the Lunchbox Assassins (dev folder)\n\n- `node tools/build.mjs` builds `../Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-183420.html` (and `build/game.js`).\n- `node tests/run.mjs [filter] [--fast]` runs every check: headless suites, then the browser bundle and the real AI Hub\n  harness (needs `handoff/node_modules`: `cd handoff && npm install`). It prints only failures and one count line.\n- `node tools/patch-engine.mjs` re-applies the engine patches (`engine/PATCHES.md`).\n- `node tools/shot.mjs <name> \"<js>\" [ms] [WxH]` saves a screenshot to `shots/`.\n- `src/` is the game in load order (see `ORDER` in `tools/build.mjs`); `index.html` plays the dev build.\nEOF\ntimeout 900 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -8","description":"Write docs and run full test suite","timeout":920000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3082,"cache_read_input_tokens":625889,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3082},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65d0dba4-d8b1-427b-bda2-f14280ca26ea","uuid":"38298717-61ce-440e-bf08-19b5c4a31a5f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T02:35:24.449Z","request_id":"req_011Cgh7DsUdFWzRoBqVxCp6k","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01V5P3tR9bs3588mPXaNctBp":{"command":"rm -f tools/dbg.cjs; cat > engine/PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine patches (BENTOU PATCH n)\n\n`engine/my-3d2dge.js` is the my-3D2dge v0.85.2 handoff engine with these small edits, applied by `node tools/patch-engine.mjs`\nfrom the pristine `handoff/my-3d2dge.js`. Each edit is marked `BENTOU PATCH n` in the source.\n\n1. Pixel font: the PlayStation face buttons ✕ ○ □ △ in the 5x7 font, so prompts render on canvas.\n2. Button symbols setting: PlayStation by default, Xbox as the option.\n3. Humanoid gear: cloth and oni masks (portraits too), jingasa and kabuto hats, yari (spear), bow, kanabo (club), an\n   offhand blade, a sashimono banner.\n4. Shell: custom screens may show settings rows (`rows: [keys]`); the 'Dev' group never shows in the player's Settings.\n5. Shell: the mouse over a button or slider moves the focus there.\n6. Shell: a 10-foot scale (`--ui`, by window height times the Interface size setting), larger base text and buttons.\n7. Music: per-track `pluck` / `ring` (plucked notes ring and decay), `attack` and `release`.\n8. Audio: `audio.voiceBus`, a gain for the gibberish voices (the Voices setting).\n9. Pause: `E.pauseGuard(game)` may veto the pause press (the AI Hub owns Create + Options).\nEOF\ncat > README.md <<'EOF'\n# Bentou 2: Birth of the Lunchbox Assassins (dev folder)\n\n- `node tools/build.mjs` builds `../Bentou2-Tenchu2-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-183420.html` (and `build/game.js`).\n- `node tests/run.mjs [filter] [--fast]` runs every check: headless suites, then the browser bundle and the real AI Hub\n  harness (needs `handoff/node_modules`: `cd handoff && npm install`). It prints only failures and one count line.\n- `node tools/patch-engine.mjs` re-applies the engine patches (`engine/PATCHES.md`).\n- `node tools/shot.mjs <name> \"<js>\" [ms] [WxH]` saves a screenshot to `shots/`.\n- `src/` is the game in load order (see `ORDER` in `tools/build.mjs`); `index.html` plays the dev build.\nEOF\ntimeout 900 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -8","description":"Write docs and run full test suite","timeout":920000}}}
